e": "IMAGE"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["img_src"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "GetNode", "title": "Get_img_src", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [210, 60], "pos": [-108.16204071044922, 425.1407165527344], "id": 102, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "*", "label": "输出", "type": "*"}], "size": [210, 60], "pos": [307.5612487792969, 578.55126953125], "widgets_values": ["str_prompt"], "inputs": [{"name": "STRING", "link": 163, "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 93, "type": "SetNode", "properties": {"previousName": "str_prompt", "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 33}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [163], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [380.2958679199219, 298.87664794921875], "pos": [-105.16993713378906, 550.5263671875], "widgets_values": ["This is a beautifully rendered, atmospheric illustration of an anime-style girl standing on wet stone steps during a rainstorm.\n\n**Central Figure:**\nThe focal point is a young woman with long, dark black hair that flows dramatically to her right side as if caught by the wind or movement. A striking splash of vibrant blue highlights streaks through her hair near the end, adding a dynamic and unique touch. She has large, expressive eyes—blue irises—and fair skin. Her gaze is directed over her shoulder toward the viewer, creating an engaging connection. She wears a classic school uniform consisting of:\n- A white short-sleeved blouse.\n- A pleated black skirt that flares out slightly at the hem.\n- Black thigh-high stockings.\n- White loafers with thick soles (a style reminiscent of 1950s fashion).\nShe carries a sleek, structured black leather backpack slung over one shoulder.\n\nHer posture suggests she's paused mid-way down stairs; one foot is planted firmly while the other is lifted off the step, capturing a moment of motion within stillness.\n\n**Environment & Atmosphere:**\nThe scene takes place outdoors under heavy rainfall. Raindrops are clearly visible falling vertically across the entire frame, glistening against surfaces like the pavement, railings, and foliage. The air appears misty and damp, lending depth and moodiness to the background which fades into soft focus.\n\nThe setting features old-world charm:\n- Stone staircases flank either side of the central figure, bordered by ornate black wrought iron railings.\n- Several vintage-style street lamps stand along the path, their warm yellow light glowing brightly despite the gloom outside—a key contrast element. Their illumination reflects softly on puddles below.\n- Mature trees line the walkway, some branches arching overhead, framing the upper part of the composition.\n- In the blurred distance behind her, European-inspired buildings can be discerned, suggesting a quaint town square or university campus environment.\n\n**Artistic Style & Lighting:**\nThe artwork exhibits high-quality digital painting techniques common in modern AI-generated art. It blends realistic textures—with detailed rendering of fabric folds, water droplets, metal grilles—with stylized character design typical of Japanese animation. The lighting masterfully uses chiaroscuro effects from the lamp posts to create pockets of warmth amidst cool blues and greys of the rainy day, enhancing emotional impact.\n\nOverall, it evokes feelings of quiet solitude, introspection, perhaps even melancholy beauty—the kind often associated with “rainy-day” scenes in literature or film—an ideal backdrop for contemplation or adventure ahead."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 217, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 84, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "1.2.5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 31}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [147], "label": "LA